---

## ⚠️ Limitations

- 🖼️ Only **text-based PDFs** are supported. Scanned or image-only resumes won't be read (no OCR).
- 🤖 Match scores are AI-generated estimates, not hiring decisions.
- 🌐 Requires an internet connection and a valid Groq API key.

---

## 🔮 Future Improvements

- 🔍 OCR support for scanned resumes
- 📑 DOCX resume support
- 📥 Export the match report as a PDF
- 🗂️ Compare one resume against several jobs at once
- ✍️ AI-generated tailored cover letters

